            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, carefully. Use a wide fan tip or surface cleaner, moderate pressure, and keep the wand at least a foot from the surface. High pressure at close range can loosen stones and roughen the surface. Killing the moss first with a treatment makes it lift off with less pressure."
          }
