          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "When is the best time to remove moss?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Late spring or early fall, on a dry stretch. Moss is easiest to scrape when it is dry and brittle, and treatments work best without rain soon after. Fall is also a good time because it clears the surface before winter freeze-thaw cycles, and it leaves the drive ready for sealing the following season."
          }
